### Feature Description

Add anthropic reasoning support to bedrock. `vertexAnthropic` supports reasoning via:

```typescript
providerOptions: {
    anthropic: {
        thinking: { type: 'enabled', budgetTokens: 1024 }
     }
},
```

Adding support to the bedrock provider as well would be beneficial



### Use Cases

Having reasoning support for anthropic claude models in bedrock would be nice.

### Additional context

Based off of my two second look, you can add an additional field like below to the `BedrockChatSettings` and have the reasoning enabled:

```
{
	"additionalModelRequestFields": {
		"reasoning_config": {
			"budget_tokens": 1024,
			"type": "enabled"
		}
	}
}
```

I took a quick stab at this in #4980 for reference. My next comment has some testing notes.
